WEBVTT

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.520
The future is a blank canvas!

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.440
We can paint any dream we want on it!

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.310
Now for the fanfare where 
the dream finally begins!

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.260
<i>Our youth is still going strong</i>

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:20.910
Okay, we're all done!

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.990
Thank you very much!

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.200
Ugh, don't get so close.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.350
You'll get me dirty.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:31.660
You're the one who got close to <i>me</i>.

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:32.790
Talk about annoying.

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:36.940
What the hell was that?!

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:37.930
My hand slipped.

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.750
You jerk!

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.520
Okay, good shoot!

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:47.000
The showers are through that 
door and to your right.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.400
You've got another appointment, so hurry!

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.190
Let's go!

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:53.440
Jeez...

00:00:54.350 --> 00:00:57.430
Hiyoko, you really sound 
like a manager lately.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:01.420
Really? I'm used to their fightin', at least.

00:01:01.860 --> 00:01:03.450
I have to step away for a bit.

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:05.330
I'll leave them to you.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:06.940
Yes, ma'am!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:19.110
Damn it, this won't come out.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:22.210
Hey, any shampoo in yours?

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:23.700
Here.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.870
Hey, it's empty.

00:01:28.870 --> 00:01:31.070
That'd be because I just used the last of it.

00:01:32.130 --> 00:01:33.650
You jerk!

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:35.990
It's not my fault I had to use it all.

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:38.490
Hello!

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.570
Anyone out there?

00:01:40.570 --> 00:01:42.440
Shampoo, please!

00:01:43.090 --> 00:01:44.040
Okay!

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:56.150
Y-You... You shouldn't be in here!

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:58.010
But ya need shampoo.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.140
Here.

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.890
These are the men's showers, you know!

00:02:01.890 --> 00:02:04.770
You're the only ones here, so it's no problem.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:07.000
I'll take your dirty uniforms with me.

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.420
She's not a real girl.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.500
Does she even know the meaning of "tact"?

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.150
Right, then...

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.800
Our next appointment is...

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.520
<b>Nagisa</b>

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.520
<b></b>Cell

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.520
<b></b>Notify

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:23.520
<b></b>Send a Message

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:26.930
Nagisa! It's been forever!

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:31.500
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:36.010
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:02:36.010 --> 00:02:40.380
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:44.350
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:55.980
<i>I need more love, want to see you again soon</i>

00:02:55.980 --> 00:03:00.070
<i>Lock eyes with you and tell you</i>

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:03.990
<i>My sincerest "Thank you for everything"</i>

00:03:03.990 --> 00:03:08.250
<i>Will you love me—not 
as a fan, but for real?</i>

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:11.300
<i>"Pick me"</i>

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:15.000
<i>"No, pick me"</i>

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:19.880
<i>Choose which kiss you want</i>

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:23.000
<i>And let your Romeo bind you</i>

00:03:24.260 --> 00:03:27.520
<i>I'm charmed by how you go all-out</i>

00:03:27.520 --> 00:03:32.060
<i>I'm charmed watching you sing with me</i>

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:35.400
<i>I'm even charmed by your tears</i>

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:39.790
<i>I'm charmed by your supportive smile</i>

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:43.410
<i>Thank you for coming to meet me</i>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:47.710
<i>Thank you for calling my name</i>

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:52.250
<i>"I must kiss you," says your Romeo</i>

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:56.450
<i>Glad that you exist and that he met you</i>

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:02.090
These are Full Throttle4 concert tickets.

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:02.970
Ma'am?

00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:04.360
Why give them to us?

00:04:04.740 --> 00:04:09.010
You can learn something from watching 
artists of their caliber live.

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:13.640
They're known as true talent. 
Go catch their performance up close.

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.570
Sure, let's see if FT4 really has the goods.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:26.530
I'll give their stage work 
a thorough evaluation.

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.950
There's a ticket for you, too, Hiyori-chan.

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:36.250
Thank you, ma'am, but I'm 
already goin' to that show.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.120
How did <i>you</i> get tickets?

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.910
Are you in their fan club?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:45.050
I'm not, but an old friend of mine is.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.260
Old friend?

00:04:46.940 --> 00:04:51.500
Yeah, me and Nagisa have been 
neighbors since we were little.

00:04:51.500 --> 00:04:55.940
Nagisa's a huge FT4 fan, 
and comin' to Tokyo for that show!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:58.400
Just for one show?

00:04:58.400 --> 00:04:59.410
Yep.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:03.140
I can believe it! They've got
 a lot of hardcore fans.

00:05:04.220 --> 00:05:07.470
And Nagisa bought me a ticket, too!

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:11.040
Well, then, why don't you all go together?

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.900
Dress up in style and have a good time.

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:16.100
Dress up?

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:19.500
Do people need to dress up for live shows?

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:22.160
Well, you don't <i>need</i> to...

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:24.510
But I think most of the girls will.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.890
Haven't you seen <i>our</i> live shows?

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:31.060
All the fans were dressed to impress.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:33.430
It's their chance to meet 
the artists they like.

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:35.850
They wear date clothes.

00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:37.560
Uh-huh...

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:40.540
What are you planning to wear, exactly?

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:44.160
Don't tell me you're planning 
to go in clothes like <i>those</i>.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:45.660
Huh?

00:05:46.420 --> 00:05:48.990
Um... these aren't okay?

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:52.120
It's scary that you think they are.

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.550
B-But I don't have much money this month.

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:58.830
And I'm busy...

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.420
You use excuses like "I don't 
have money" and "I'm busy"

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.990
to not care about your appearance.

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.460
You might as well not be a girl.

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:10.550
"In training" or not, I've always 
thought it was problematic

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:13.220
for our manager to have 
the style of a potato.

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.560
Especially if we're going to a show together.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:18.440
You'll be unsophisticated 
forever if we let you.

00:06:20.970 --> 00:06:21.680
Huh?

00:06:22.020 --> 00:06:23.770
You're coming with us.

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:25.300
We'll fix you.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:29.700
No, thank you!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:30.680
Hey, stop!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:31.930
Why are you running away?!

00:06:36.850 --> 00:06:38.960
You're stylish, huh, Juri-chan?

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:40.530
Hmm?

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.820
Yeah, I love fashion.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.710
The teachers gave you a talking-to

00:06:45.360 --> 00:06:46.710
about your skirt length.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:50.220
Come on, a miniskirt goes 
best with my hairstyle.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.480
Wow, you put a lot of thought into it.

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:55.370
I just dress the way I like, that's all.

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.640
Well, no, there's more to it now.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:03.590
My boyfriend told me I look cute this way.

00:07:04.210 --> 00:07:05.920
And mad teachers or not,

00:07:05.920 --> 00:07:08.230
who doesn't want their boyfriend 
to think they're cute?

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.480
<i>Juri-chan </i>is<i> cute.</i>

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.280
<i>Is it 'cause she's in love?</i>

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.060
Do you want to get stylish, Hiyori?

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.450
Find someone you like?

00:07:18.670 --> 00:07:19.620
Who?

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:25.670
N-No, there's no one! Track is my only love!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:29.240
<i>So there's no need to look cute!</i>

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:31.180
<i>But...</i>

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.590
Setoguchi-senpai, you're really cute.

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:38.070
Huh? Where did that come from?

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:40.310
Is there someone you like?

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.640
What?

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:43.780
There... kind of is?

00:07:43.780 --> 00:07:45.560
Or was?

00:07:46.010 --> 00:07:47.610
Is it that soccer player?

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:49.380
You mean Kotaro?

00:07:49.380 --> 00:07:52.830
No! We just live next door to each other!

00:07:54.850 --> 00:07:56.560
<i>She's so cute!</i>

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:03.190
Dressin' up, eh?

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:05.760
Oh, hello, Aizo-kun and Yujiro-kun!

00:08:09.460 --> 00:08:11.410
<i>It's the actress from the "Romeo" video!</i>

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:13.340
What was her name...

00:08:14.730 --> 00:08:16.240
Oh, yeah! Narumi Sena!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.630
Narumi-san!

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:19.970
We haven't seen you in a while.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.700
Not since "Romeo."

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.980
You two are so popular now.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.510
So are you. I heard you're 
going to be in a TV drama.

00:08:27.510 --> 00:08:29.970
Everyone's talking about it!

00:08:30.570 --> 00:08:32.270
I'm so nervous.

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.040
But I look forward to it!

00:08:34.470 --> 00:08:37.810
<i>What is with that overwhelming cuteness?!</i>

00:08:41.670 --> 00:08:45.590
<i>There are a lot of cute 
girls in this world, huh?</i>

00:08:45.590 --> 00:08:48.000
Hey, you're super cute!

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:50.310
Aw, baby, where're you going?

00:08:50.310 --> 00:08:51.570
Please stop!

00:08:51.570 --> 00:08:53.400
Let's go have some fun.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.760
I don't want to. Please let me by.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:58.330
Come on, just for a little while.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.230
Gotcha!

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:01.250
Hey!

00:09:01.250 --> 00:09:02.930
Come on, what's the problem?

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:07.070
Ow.

00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:09.200
What was that for, you bitch?

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.440
She told you no.

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.450
Mind your own business!

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.600
Nobodies like you shouldn't 
try to steal the scene.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:20.080
Mr. Policeman, over here!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:20.910
Let's go.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:24.580
Hey! Get back here!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.330
Hold it, you!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:39.850
Okay, we got away.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.650
Sorry to take off running so suddenly.

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:45.450
Don't be sorry. Thank you!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:49.360
<i>This girl is super cute!</i>

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:56.040
Ooh, crêpes!

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:58.600
Which would you like? 
It's my treat, as a thank you.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.320
Really?!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:05.080
N-No, wait, I can't have someone 
I just met treatin' me.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.350
Every time I pass by here,
I want to get a crêpe,

00:10:09.350 --> 00:10:11.140
but it feels weird to eat one alone.

00:10:11.460 --> 00:10:13.460
You'd be doing me a favor.

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:17.970
In that case, I happily accept!

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.870
It's delicious! This Kumamaru 
Special is the best!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:27.230
I'm so glad you're enjoying it.

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.390
How's the Panmy crêpe?

00:10:29.740 --> 00:10:31.600
Want a taste?

00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:34.150
Yeah! Thank you!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:37.900
It's delicious!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.490
Have a bite of mine!

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.450
Okay.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:46.450
Well?

00:10:46.730 --> 00:10:48.140
It's delicious!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:53.720
What?

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:58.030
Sorry, I was just thinkin' 
you really are cute.

00:10:58.030 --> 00:11:00.590
No wonder people hit on ya.

00:11:00.950 --> 00:11:04.510
Meanwhile, I'm just an extra.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:05.330
An extra?

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:09.950
Yeah. A bit part with no name 
and no lines. Just one of many.

00:11:10.600 --> 00:11:14.090
Only cute girls can be heroines.

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:17.170
Even if I dressed up, I wouldn't look right.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.380
I understand how you feel.

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:25.240
I was insecure for a long time, too.

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:28.370
Even though you're so cute?

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:32.620
There's this really cute girl I know.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:36.300
I was jealous. I envied her.

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:43.110
I depressed myself by thinking, 
"Meanwhile, I'm just..."

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:48.370
But what I figured out 
recently is, I am who I am.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.390
I decided that there's no point 
in comparing myself to others...

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:58.180
That whether we're bit parts 
or heroines is up to us.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:02.360
I think you can be a heroine.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.270
Huh?

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:05.750
I'm not sure...

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:09.210
Well, heroines are loved by others, right?

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:12.370
And I'm having fun with you.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.630
I really like you.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:20.010
I like you, too! Um...

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.880
Mona. Narumi Mona.

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:27.510
I'm Suzumi Hiyori! I like you, too, Mona-chan!

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:30.960
Then we can become heroines, huh?

00:12:30.960 --> 00:12:31.890
Yep!

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:38.650
See you, Mona-chan!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.600
See you!

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.110
Wait, your phone number!

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:53.210
<i>Well, I feel like I'll see her again.</i>

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:56.250
<i>Maybe I'll try dressin' up!</i>

00:12:56.250 --> 00:13:01.250
New Idol Fest

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:06.010
<i>I don't actually know </i>how<i>, though.</i>

00:13:09.960 --> 00:13:12.890
<i>Oh, there's a fashion article.</i>

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:15.980
Maybe if I study articles like this...

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:17.520
What are you doing?

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.640
O-Oh, hello!

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:23.690
I thought I should check out the 
magazines you're in, you know?

00:13:23.910 --> 00:13:27.570
I <i>am</i> your manager... in training.

00:13:27.800 --> 00:13:33.830
Well, I've worked hard today! 
Okay, I'll head home now!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.650
What's with her?

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:36.860
Very suspicious.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.210
<b>Become a
\h\h\h\h"Beloved Heroine,"
\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hStarting Today!</b>

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.970
"I'll become a beloved heroine,
 starting today!"

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.970
"My bit part life is over!"

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:55.980
<i>I've been spotted by the last 
people I wanted to see me.</i>

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:57.630
Whatcha doing?

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.020
N-Nothin'.

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:01.230
You were real intent on those magazines.

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:04.550
I thought you didn't care about fashion?

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:09.360
You ran away when we tried to give 
you polish. Why the change of heart?

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.490
N-No reason!

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:12.370
Bye!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:13.820
Not so fast.

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:21.530
So you wanted to go from 
bit part to heroine.

00:14:21.530 --> 00:14:23.820
You wanted to dress up.

00:14:23.820 --> 00:14:25.550
I'm sorry.

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.410
Why are you apologizing?

00:14:27.410 --> 00:14:31.700
Lookin' at magazines, I think, 
"That looks good, that looks cute,"

00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:34.710
but I just don't think it'd suit me.

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:39.060
What makes you think that 
before you've even tried?

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:42.320
Once, when I was little,

00:14:42.950 --> 00:14:48.070
I went to a family wedding, 
and I wore a cute dress.

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:52.730
I felt like a princess. 
I was all happy and excited.

00:14:53.210 --> 00:14:56.330
But then Nagisa told me...

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:59.830
"That looks weird on you!"

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:04.760
So I started avoidin' girly clothes.

00:15:04.760 --> 00:15:07.970
So Nagisa's the problem. Nagisa sucks.

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:11.390
Says the guy who calls her "Potato Face."

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:14.100
Like it'd be any better coming from you.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:20.320
No, Nagisa is a good friend. 
Always supportin' my track dreams and stuff.

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:24.110
Nagisa is nice, and smart, 
and loved by everyone.

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:27.590
So when Nagisa said it, I had to believe it.

00:15:27.900 --> 00:15:30.990
I realized I couldn't be a princess.

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:32.330
Sure you can.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:37.540
LIP×LIP calls our fans 
"Julieta" all the time, right?

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:40.740
In other words, all girls are princesses.

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:42.510
All of us?

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:43.380
That's right.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:48.130
But not if you don't do something. 
You gotta make an effort.

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:51.380
But can I really do it?

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:56.510
Effort is your specialty, right? 
If you really want to change, you can.

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:01.990
Shibasaki-kun, Someya-kun!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:05.650
That was pretty touching! 
Idols give good speeches.

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:10.650
Right? So let's style you like a 
heroine and show you off to Nagisa.

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.410
We'll be your producers.

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:14.130
Uh-huh!

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:21.410
It's not often I see you two together.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.500
Do something with her.

00:16:25.810 --> 00:16:28.290
Can anything be done?

00:16:31.190 --> 00:16:32.520
Leave it to me.

00:16:34.520 --> 00:16:36.810
Any itchy places?

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:38.930
N-No, ma'am.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:39.710
This one, yeah?

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.300
Looks like a mushroom.

00:16:41.300 --> 00:16:42.110
How about this?

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:43.210
Looks like a kappa.

00:16:43.210 --> 00:16:45.320
<i>What're they gonna do to me?!</i>

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.800
Stay still, please.

00:16:48.730 --> 00:16:49.660
This one.

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.940
Okay.

00:16:50.940 --> 00:16:52.850
<i>Which one?!</i>

00:16:53.870 --> 00:16:55.820
Here we go.

00:17:07.880 --> 00:17:10.290
Done. What do you think?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:20.630
It's amazin'... I look totally different.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:24.650
Okay, we'll start here.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:26.140
Here?!

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:30.210
I've never been in a store this stylish.

00:17:30.210 --> 00:17:33.540
There's no point in going to 
the same stores as always!

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.530
But...

00:17:35.990 --> 00:17:38.780
We're not telling you to go in alone.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:42.680
We'll take point. We're gonna find 
an outfit that looks good on you.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.160
Yes, please!

00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:55.420
Wow! So many cute clothes!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:07.060
<i>This is startin' to feel fun.</i>

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:12.320
This one. We gotta go this hard if 
we're gonna beat Nagisa the FT4 fan.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:14.580
You think <i>that</i> can win?

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:18.860
Nagisa sounds like a popular girl, 
so we need to be at least this refined.

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:20.990
You call <i>that</i> "refined"?

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:24.240
Mine is a hundred times better.
 Take a seat, Aizo.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.120
I like this one!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.570
Out of the question.

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:34.170
I almost look like someone else!

00:18:35.130 --> 00:18:36.650
This'll work.

00:18:36.650 --> 00:18:37.860
Agreed.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:40.440
I said I'm paying!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:41.850
No, I'm paying!

00:18:44.570 --> 00:18:46.570
Here you are, ma'am.

00:18:47.310 --> 00:18:49.310
<b>Keep out!</b>

00:18:50.140 --> 00:18:53.060
Ms. President, what's that about?

00:18:53.460 --> 00:18:55.520
A top-secret lesson, they said.

00:18:55.520 --> 00:18:57.070
But it's their day off...

00:18:57.530 --> 00:18:59.290
What could they be doing?

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:00.980
The lesson is for Hiyori-chan.

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:02.570
What?

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:09.460
How's this?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.550
"Monster" would be a kind term.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:14.090
It's not effects makeup, okay?

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:19.090
Well, I've never put on makeup before.

00:19:20.950 --> 00:19:25.550
Heavy makeup only works for 
adult women and sexy people.

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:28.100
On a high school student, 
it just looks garish.

00:19:28.840 --> 00:19:31.100
Color-wise... you want this range.

00:19:33.870 --> 00:19:34.660
Stay still.

00:19:34.660 --> 00:19:37.450
Huh? Wh-What?!

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:39.850
I'm going to teach you how to do it.

00:19:39.850 --> 00:19:41.750
N-No, thank you!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:45.060
What, you've got a problem 
with my makeup skills?

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:47.750
Th-That's not what I...

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:52.000
<i>Extreme close-ups of idols 
are bad for my heart!</i>

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.630
Do it, Yujiro.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:55.870
On it.

00:19:57.260 --> 00:20:01.420
You want to become a heroine, 
right? Get your head in the game.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.640
<i>Sure, I want to, if I can.</i>

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:11.890
Go!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:13.820
You're slouching!

00:20:13.820 --> 00:20:15.650
Head up! Chest out!

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:16.780
Yes, sir!

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:21.850
<i>I've never been in love, 
but I want to be someday. So...</i>

00:20:21.850 --> 00:20:23.520
Your face looks frozen!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:24.580
Smile!

00:20:26.360 --> 00:20:29.410
<i>I'm gonna be a cute heroine!</i>

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:35.790
Um...

00:20:36.290 --> 00:20:38.410
The arrival platform is this way.

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:44.050
You didn't have to come 
with me. I know you're busy...

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.650
You'd get lost on your own.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:51.060
And we should meet your friend if 
we're going to the concert together.

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:54.690
Oh.

00:20:55.140 --> 00:20:58.140
<i>I feel like I'm gettin' closer to them.</i>

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:01.320
<i>Maybe they're startin' to respect me?</i>

00:21:01.320 --> 00:21:06.050
<i>Behold our production powers, FT4 girl!</i>

00:21:06.050 --> 00:21:08.990
<i>I can't wait to see Nagisa's shock.</i>

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.960
Hmm...

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:21.250
Oh, there. Nagisa!

00:21:21.700 --> 00:21:23.130
Hiyori?

00:21:30.140 --> 00:21:33.590
That was close! I see ya still 
run in places ya shouldn't.

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:34.970
Gotta be more careful.

00:21:35.610 --> 00:21:36.840
I got excited.

00:21:38.520 --> 00:21:41.520
Let me introduce you. 
This is my childhood friend...

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:44.150
Shiranami Nagisa-kun!

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.830
Your childhood friend...

00:21:45.830 --> 00:21:47.530
...is a dude?

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:55.040
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:55.040
<b>Producing Hiyori.</b>

00:21:55.400 --> 00:21:59.680
<i>Everyone wants to look cuter</i>

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:04.050
<i>We're aware of each other, 
even if we pretend not to be</i>

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:08.440
<i>I put on older-girl makeup, 
and my heart is pounding</i>

00:22:08.440 --> 00:22:12.680
<i>But you have to notice, or it's pointless!</i>

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:25.940
<i>Gotta worry about who we 
like, whether we're dating</i>

00:22:25.940 --> 00:22:30.450
<i>Which clothes are cool, and final exams</i>

00:22:30.450 --> 00:22:34.710
<i>We're so busy every day</i>

00:22:34.710 --> 00:22:38.790
<i>Because we're girls, so 
there's no changing it</i>

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:43.580
<i>Sometimes I do what people want cuz 
it's a hassle to decide for myself</i>

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:47.800
<i>I've got secrets, and I 
get into fights sometimes</i>

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:52.610
<i>Troubled girls will find princes</i>

00:22:52.610 --> 00:22:56.210
<i>Even "good morning" is a struggle for me</i>

00:22:56.210 --> 00:22:58.940
<i>Smile back!</i>

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:03.270
<i>I told a lie, cuz I'm 
so into you I can't even</i>

00:23:03.270 --> 00:23:07.780
<i>I put on scented lip gloss 
and learned new makeup...</i>

00:23:07.780 --> 00:23:14.150
<i>I think about you morning, noon, and night</i>

00:23:14.150 --> 00:23:16.680
<i>And I imagine you, too</i>

00:23:16.680 --> 00:23:21.000
<i>I won't let the times we're 
apart make me give up</i>

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:25.040
<i>I'll get cuter, so find me, okay?</i>

00:23:26.300 --> 00:23:32.970
Next time, on episode 7 of 
<i>Heroines Run the Show</i>...

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:35.050
"My Childhood Friend"!

00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Episode 7
My Childhood Friend</b>
